ef** in a Japanese meat market or processing facility. The presence of grading stamps (A4, B3), inspectors in protective gear, and systematic evaluation confirms this.\n\n**Answer ‘0’ is correct.**\n', '\n=== Batch 30-60 (30 frames) ===\nFrames: /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4133.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4134.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4135.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4136.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4137.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4138.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4139.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4168.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4169.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4170.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4171.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4172.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4173.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4174.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4175.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4176.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4177.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4178.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4179.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4180.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4181.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4182.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/frames/frame_4183.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/KktLi3UifPY/f